 "notes": "SIGNATURE. Side, pile, overhead — three different blunt shapes, and a weapon art that is a whirl rather than a stomp. It also comes off the target a full hitstop tier faster than the rest of its class, which is what lets a great hammer be swung at something that moves.\n\nLineage: pile — The Xanmeer pile-driver. Straight down, every time.\nMandatory slots present: 25/25. Total slots: 30.\nart.1/art.2 trigger: the schema's trigger block cannot express a chord, so the declared button is 'two_hand' with modifier hold/double_tap. The runtime conjunction is 'heavy pressed while two_hand is HELD' (art.1) and 'heavy HELD while two_hand is HELD' (art.2) — game/data/weapons/input-map.json is authoritative and machine-readable."
}
